{
  "text": "奇門遁甲秘笈大全",
  "juan": "Juan7",
  "section": "卷七",
  "entries": [
    {
      "line_id": "QMDJ_Juan7_P000_S000",
      "original_quote": "《卷七》",
      "paragraph_index": 0,
      "tag": []
    },
    {
      "line_id": "QMDJ_Juan7_P001_S000",
      "original_quote": "奇門主客占驗論",
      "paragraph_index": 1,
      "tag": []
    },
    {
      "line_id": "QMDJ_Juan7_P002_S000",
      "original_quote": "論曰：奇門之應驗，時有先後，應有主客，以彼此人我而推之。",
      "paragraph_index": 2,
      "tag": []
    },
    {
      "line_id": "QMDJ_Juan7_P002_S001",
      "original_quote": "大凡奇神應物之初，星應事之中，門應事之末，依次推詳，無不應驗如神。",
      "paragraph_index": 2,
      "tag": []
    },
    {
      "line_id": "QMDJ_Juan7_P002_S002",
      "original_quote": "若我去尋人，我為客他為 主，以天盤之星為我，地盤之星為他；",
      "paragraph_index": 2,
      "tag": []
    },
    {
      "line_id": "QMDJ_Juan7_P002_S003",
      "original_quote": "如他來尋我，他為客我為主，以天盤之星為他，地盤之星為我。",
      "paragraph_index": 2,
      "tag": []
    },
    {
      "line_id": "QMDJ_Juan7_P002_S004",
      "original_quote": "看他來生我，我去生他，他生我，益在我；",
      "paragraph_index": 2,
      "tag": []
    },
    {
      "line_id": "QMDJ_Juan7_P002_S005",
      "original_quote": "我生他，益在他；",
      "paragraph_index": 2,
      "tag": []
    },
    {
      "line_id": "QMDJ_Juan7_P002_S006",
      "original_quote": "他剋我，損在我；",
      "paragraph_index": 2,
      "tag": []
    },
    {
      "line_id": "QMDJ_Juan7_P002_S007",
      "original_quote": "我剋他，損在他。",
      "paragraph_index": 2,
      "tag": []
    },
    {
      "line_id": "QMDJ_Juan7_P002_S008",
      "original_quote": "又以陰日之天盤星為我，陽日之地盤星為他，比和無損益，須仿此而推之。",
      "paragraph_index": 2,
      "tag": []
    },
    {
      "line_id": "QMDJ_Juan7_P003_S000",
      "original_quote": "奇門曰：「有陽無陽，德祿在門，無陽半吉，有陽欣欣」。",
      "paragraph_index": 3,
      "tag": []
    },
    {
      "line_id": "QMDJ_Juan7_P003_S001",
      "original_quote": "此陽神系指飛值使門時適得丁奇，即為陽神得助。",
      "paragraph_index": 3,
      "tag": []
    },
    {
      "line_id": "QMDJ_Juan7_P003_S002",
      "original_quote": "如甲子值符，丁卯為陽神，甲戌值符，丁丑為陽神之類。",
      "paragraph_index": 3,
      "tag": []
    },
    {
      "line_id": "QMDJ_Juan7_P004_S000",
      "original_quote": "奇門占事計條",
      "paragraph_index": 4,
      "tag": []
    },
    {
      "line_id": "QMDJ_Juan7_P005_S000",
      "original_quote": "按奇門貴人歌與六壬同，但冬至後得陰貴，夏至後用陽貴之不用。",
      "paragraph_index": 5,
      "tag": []
    },
    {
      "line_id": "QMDJ_Juan7_P005_S001",
      "original_quote": "奇門上盤象天謂九星，中盤象人謂八門，下盤象地謂九宮，上盤星也，中盤門也，下盤 宮也。",
      "paragraph_index": 5,
      "tag": []
    },
    {
      "line_id": "QMDJ_Juan7_P005_S002",
      "original_quote": "用法凡占吉凶者，首重九星，以九星是天盤，吉凶由天故也。",
      "paragraph_index": 5,
      "tag": []
    },
    {
      "line_id": "QMDJ_Juan7_P005_S003",
      "original_quote": "凡星剋門吉，門剋星凶。",
      "paragraph_index": 5,
      "tag": []
    },
    {
      "line_id": "QMDJ_Juan7_P005_S004",
      "original_quote": "凡出行趨避者，首重八門，以八門為人盤，吉凶由自取故也。",
      "paragraph_index": 5,
      "tag": []
    },
    {
      "line_id": "QMDJ_Juan7_P005_S005",
      "original_quote": "凡門剋宮 吉，宮剋門凶，傷人事故凶。",
      "paragraph_index": 5,
      "tag": []
    },
    {
      "line_id": "QMDJ_Juan7_P005_S006",
      "original_quote": "凡造葬、遷移者，首重九宮，以九宮為地盤，遷移等事皆由地而起也，故門宮相生俱吉，相剋俱凶，茍得此意而推之。",
      "paragraph_index": 5,
      "tag": []
    },
    {
      "line_id": "QMDJ_Juan7_P005_S007",
      "original_quote": "凡事關天人者， 無不可以數通妙哉，此示人以用法。",
      "paragraph_index": 5,
      "tag": []
    },
    {
      "line_id": "QMDJ_Juan7_P006_S000",
      "original_quote": "傳曰：奇門既分三盤，上下盤俱有一干，地盤宮中有奇儀是也，上下相對一照，成格、不成格顯然可知。",
      "paragraph_index": 6,
      "tag": []
    },
    {
      "line_id": "QMDJ_Juan7_P006_S001",
      "original_quote": "如甲加丙，乙加辛之類。",
      "paragraph_index": 6,
      "tag": []
    },
    {
      "line_id": "QMDJ_Juan7_P006_S002",
      "original_quote": "惟主星之下，飛門之內，暗藏一干， 謂值使加時支法。",
      "paragraph_index": 6,
      "tag": []
    },
    {
      "line_id": "QMDJ_Juan7_P006_S003",
      "original_quote": "又值符首中起數至時干止，其由甲而丙，而乙至癸，以求時支，則八門中又帶了一干，曰「飛干」。",
      "paragraph_index": 6,
      "tag": []
    },
    {
      "line_id": "QMDJ_Juan7_P006_S004",
      "original_quote": "此干並不露干，局面上下盤之外數時支，時用 甲乙排得者，故曰暗藏，若隱若現，變化無窮，古今來無一識之者。",
      "paragraph_index": 6,
      "tag": []
    },
    {
      "line_id": "QMDJ_Juan7_P006_S005",
      "original_quote": "假如飛門內即中盤八門，既生主星飛門內忽有庚飛到此甲求時支我甲乙來不露跡。",
      "paragraph_index": 6,
      "tag": []
    },
    {
      "line_id": "QMDJ_Juan7_P007_S000",
      "original_quote": "凡百事外面雖美備，內中蹭蹬，又加飛門既剋主星，凡百事占之大凶，而飛門內忽有奇飛到即飛干之乙丙丁，凡百事外面雖凶，內中實多暗獲。",
      "paragraph_index": 7,
      "tag": []
    },
    {
      "line_id": "QMDJ_Juan7_P007_S001",
      "original_quote": "經之若隱若現，若有若無，飛干之謂也。",
      "paragraph_index": 7,
      "tag": []
    },
    {
      "line_id": "QMDJ_Juan7_P008_S000",
      "original_quote": "占投軍",
      "paragraph_index": 8,
      "tag": []
    },
    {
      "line_id": "QMDJ_Juan7_P009_S000",
      "original_quote": "天衝為武士，值符為主帥。",
      "paragraph_index": 9,
      "tag": []
    },
    {
      "line_id": "QMDJ_Juan7_P009_S001",
      "original_quote": "值符宮生天衝宮，及天衝宮生值符宮，一見即投合，如彼此相剋，定不收錄。",
      "paragraph_index": 9,
      "tag": []
    },
    {
      "line_id": "QMDJ_Juan7_P009_S002",
      "original_quote": "天衝若坐值符，一去即為部長，後必大用，伏吟空回，反吟反複不准。",
      "paragraph_index": 9,
      "tag": []
    },
    {
      "line_id": "QMDJ_Juan7_P010_S000",
      "original_quote": "占攻城",
      "paragraph_index": 10,
      "tag": []
    },
    {
      "line_id": "QMDJ_Juan7_P011_S000",
      "original_quote": "以六庚為攻者，以天禽為守者原法云：庚者兵眾，禽者，中心者攻之，故受攻。",
      "paragraph_index": 11,
      "tag": []
    },
    {
      "line_id": "QMDJ_Juan7_P011_S001",
      "original_quote": "如六庚乘旺相，得開門加中五宮城必破可見中五宮亦有門，行到此不奇之驗。",
      "paragraph_index": 11,
      "tag": []
    },
    {
      "line_id": "QMDJ_Juan7_P011_S002",
      "original_quote": "又看地盤天禽所乘之宮，得旺相及吉門者，其守將不可擒也，反此必死。",
      "paragraph_index": 11,
      "tag": []
    },
    {
      "line_id": "QMDJ_Juan7_P012_S000",
      "original_quote": "占守城",
      "paragraph_index": 12,
      "tag": []
    },
    {
      "line_id": "QMDJ_Juan7_P013_S000",
      "original_quote": "以天禽為守者，天蓬、六庚為攻者，天禽宮得休、生、開、景，又旺相有六丙，其城不破。",
      "paragraph_index": 13,
      "tag": []
    },
    {
      "line_id": "QMDJ_Juan7_P013_S001",
      "original_quote": "如無旺相及吉門，再犯天蓬、六庚，又中宮，不能守斷。",
      "paragraph_index": 13,
      "tag": []
    },
    {
      "line_id": "QMDJ_Juan7_P014_S000",
      "original_quote": "占盜賊",
      "paragraph_index": 14,
      "tag": []
    },
    {
      "line_id": "QMDJ_Juan7_P015_S000",
      "original_quote": "敵兵來去先分界限，冬至以後以坎艮震巽為內，離坤兌干四宮為不至，六庚落宮被剋者，為安營不穩，自驚而退。",
      "paragraph_index": 15,
      "tag": []
    },
    {
      "line_id": "QMDJ_Juan7_P015_S001",
      "original_quote": "六庚剋所落之宮，又逢元武、天蓬、白虎之神，乘必 大戰。",
      "paragraph_index": 15,
      "tag": []
    },
    {
      "line_id": "QMDJ_Juan7_P015_S002",
      "original_quote": "庚得九天，則大張聲勢，鳴鼓而進。",
      "paragraph_index": 15,
      "tag": []
    },
    {
      "line_id": "QMDJ_Juan7_P015_S003",
      "original_quote": "庚得九地，則掩旗息鼓而來。",
      "paragraph_index": 15,
      "tag": []
    },
    {
      "line_id": "QMDJ_Juan7_P015_S004",
      "original_quote": "如賊已入境，占其何時去？",
      "paragraph_index": 15,
      "tag": []
    },
    {
      "line_id": "QMDJ_Juan7_P015_S005",
      "original_quote": "看六庚在內四宮為不去，在外四宮為去。",
      "paragraph_index": 15,
      "tag": []
    },
    {
      "line_id": "QMDJ_Juan7_P015_S006",
      "original_quote": "總以六庚地盤干支年月 日時為去來之期，庚加年年為方吉之類。",
      "paragraph_index": 15,
      "tag": []
    },
    {
      "line_id": "QMDJ_Juan7_P015_S007",
      "original_quote": "如太白入熒，雖賊來，若在外界外四宮，亦主不來；",
      "paragraph_index": 15,
      "tag": []
    },
    {
      "line_id": "QMDJ_Juan7_P015_S008",
      "original_quote": "熒入太白，雖主賊去，若在內界，亦不去。",
      "paragraph_index": 15,
      "tag": []
    },
    {
      "line_id": "QMDJ_Juan7_P016_S000",
      "original_quote": "占賊臨境城可守否",
      "paragraph_index": 16,
      "tag": []
    },
    {
      "line_id": "QMDJ_Juan7_P017_S000",
      "original_quote": "以時干宮為客，時支宮為主即符使之宮，看其生剋何如？",
      "paragraph_index": 17,
      "tag": []
    },
    {
      "line_id": "QMDJ_Juan7_P017_S001",
      "original_quote": "如時支宮地盤受值符所落之宮剋制，而時支又乘六庚、元武，此城當棄。",
      "paragraph_index": 17,
      "tag": []
    },
    {
      "line_id": "QMDJ_Juan7_P017_S002",
      "original_quote": "或值使宮自被下剋，此城亦不可居，速宜退避。",
      "paragraph_index": 17,
      "tag": []
    },
    {
      "line_id": "QMDJ_Juan7_P017_S003",
      "original_quote": "如值符宮與值使宮相生、相比，或值符宮自受刑剋，敵人三來，不能取勝，守之無妨。",
      "paragraph_index": 17,
      "tag": []
    },
    {
      "line_id": "QMDJ_Juan7_P018_S000",
      "original_quote": "占勝敗",
      "paragraph_index": 18,
      "tag": []
    },
    {
      "line_id": "QMDJ_Juan7_P019_S000",
      "original_quote": "凡戰陣以景、驚二門主之。",
      "paragraph_index": 19,
      "tag": []
    },
    {
      "line_id": "QMDJ_Juan7_P019_S001",
      "original_quote": "經曰：景門宜破陣。",
      "paragraph_index": 19,
      "tag": []
    },
    {
      "line_id": "QMDJ_Juan7_P019_S002",
      "original_quote": "又治亂之法，要視驚門，當以值符所落之宮為主，六庚所落之宮為客。",
      "paragraph_index": 19,
      "tag": []
    },
    {
      "line_id": "QMDJ_Juan7_P019_S003",
      "original_quote": "值符宮剋六庚之宮，主勝；",
      "paragraph_index": 19,
      "tag": []
    },
    {
      "line_id": "QMDJ_Juan7_P019_S004",
      "original_quote": "六庚宮剋值符之宮， 客勝。",
      "paragraph_index": 19,
      "tag": []
    },
    {
      "line_id": "QMDJ_Juan7_P019_S005",
      "original_quote": "又論旺相為勝，休囚為負。",
      "paragraph_index": 19,
      "tag": []
    },
    {
      "line_id": "QMDJ_Juan7_P019_S006",
      "original_quote": "如主得驚、景二門，或二門宮與客宮相生則客勝。",
      "paragraph_index": 19,
      "tag": []
    },
    {
      "line_id": "QMDJ_Juan7_P019_S007",
      "original_quote": "如主客宮相生，來必講和；",
      "paragraph_index": 19,
      "tag": []
    },
    {
      "line_id": "QMDJ_Juan7_P019_S008",
      "original_quote": "如主客所乘皆旺相，俱得二門，不相刑剋，其力相 等，則兩相恐懼，不戰而退。",
      "paragraph_index": 19,
      "tag": []
    },
    {
      "line_id": "QMDJ_Juan7_P019_S009",
      "original_quote": "如六庚為值符，是主客同宮，二家不分勝負。",
      "paragraph_index": 19,
      "tag": []
    },
    {
      "line_id": "QMDJ_Juan7_P019_S010",
      "original_quote": "又日干加庚主勝，庚加日干客勝。",
      "paragraph_index": 19,
      "tag": []
    },
    {
      "line_id": "QMDJ_Juan7_P019_S011",
      "original_quote": "如榖雨上元陰遁五局，丙辛日壬辰時，天柱為值符，上 帶六庚，主二家不相勝負，自相退避。",
      "paragraph_index": 19,
      "tag": []
    },
    {
      "line_id": "QMDJ_Juan7_P020_S000",
      "original_quote": "占遠信",
      "paragraph_index": 20,
      "tag": []
    },
    {
      "line_id": "QMDJ_Juan7_P021_S000",
      "original_quote": "以景門為信，歌曰：「景上投書並破陣」。",
      "paragraph_index": 21,
      "tag": []
    },
    {
      "line_id": "QMDJ_Juan7_P021_S001",
      "original_quote": "景門臨外界來遲，臨內界為速，上帶吉格，信吉；",
      "paragraph_index": 21,
      "tag": []
    },
    {
      "line_id": "QMDJ_Juan7_P021_S002",
      "original_quote": "凶格，信凶。",
      "paragraph_index": 21,
      "tag": []
    },
    {
      "line_id": "QMDJ_Juan7_P021_S003",
      "original_quote": "門迫、投江水，無信。",
      "paragraph_index": 21,
      "tag": []
    },
    {
      "line_id": "QMDJ_Juan7_P022_S000",
      "original_quote": "占大計吉凶",
      "paragraph_index": 22,
      "tag": []
    },
    {
      "line_id": "QMDJ_Juan7_P023_S000",
      "original_quote": "以值符為吏部，開門為官星，開門宮受值符宮剋制，又休囚廢沒，及不得吉星、吉格者，主拿問。",
      "paragraph_index": 23,
      "tag": []
    },
    {
      "line_id": "QMDJ_Juan7_P023_S001",
      "original_quote": "旺相者，主罷職。",
      "paragraph_index": 23,
      "tag": []
    },
    {
      "line_id": "QMDJ_Juan7_P023_S002",
      "original_quote": "得吉星降級。",
      "paragraph_index": 23,
      "tag": []
    },
    {
      "line_id": "QMDJ_Juan7_P023_S003",
      "original_quote": "開門宮不受值符宮剋制，返相生者，無事。",
      "paragraph_index": 23,
      "tag": []
    },
    {
      "line_id": "QMDJ_Juan7_P024_S000",
      "original_quote": "占領批文遲速",
      "paragraph_index": 24,
      "tag": []
    },
    {
      "line_id": "QMDJ_Juan7_P025_S000",
      "original_quote": "六丁宮與值使宮相生，則速；",
      "paragraph_index": 25,
      "tag": []
    },
    {
      "line_id": "QMDJ_Juan7_P025_S001",
      "original_quote": "相剋，則遲。",
      "paragraph_index": 25,
      "tag": []
    },
    {
      "line_id": "QMDJ_Juan7_P025_S002",
      "original_quote": "又看六丁在何處？",
      "paragraph_index": 25,
      "tag": []
    },
    {
      "line_id": "QMDJ_Juan7_P025_S003",
      "original_quote": "即以本日干支定其日期。",
      "paragraph_index": 25,
      "tag": []
    },
    {
      "line_id": "QMDJ_Juan7_P026_S000",
      "original_quote": "占新任官員賢吏及何處人",
      "paragraph_index": 26,
      "tag": []
    },
    {
      "line_id": "QMDJ_Juan7_P027_S000",
      "original_quote": "以 門為官星，九星為心性，天干為分野天盤之干。",
      "paragraph_index": 27,
      "tag": []
    },
    {
      "line_id": "QMDJ_Juan7_P027_S001",
      "original_quote": "如開門上乘吉星為好人，凶星為惡人。",
      "paragraph_index": 27,
      "tag": []
    },
    {
      "line_id": "QMDJ_Juan7_P027_S002",
      "original_quote": "天輔心性文明，天任仁慈，天心善心正直，天禽忠厚，天衝風厲，天英轟 烈，天芮貪毒，天柱奸宄大惡。",
      "paragraph_index": 27,
      "tag": []
    },
    {
      "line_id": "QMDJ_Juan7_P027_S003",
      "original_quote": "甲蠻，乙海外及東夷，丙楚，丁岱江、淮南，戊己韓、魏、中州、何濟，庚秦，辛華，壬燕、趙，癸常山。",
      "paragraph_index": 27,
      "tag": []
    },
    {
      "line_id": "QMDJ_Juan7_P028_S000",
      "original_quote": "占官事催提緩急",
      "paragraph_index": 28,
      "tag": []
    },
    {
      "line_id": "QMDJ_Juan7_P029_S000",
      "original_quote": "以時干為我，日干為官長，六丁為公文，值使為公差。",
      "paragraph_index": 29,
      "tag": []
    },
    {
      "line_id": "QMDJ_Juan7_P029_S001",
      "original_quote": "若值符宮剋天乙宮按此天乙，時干也。",
      "paragraph_index": 29,
      "tag": []
    },
    {
      "line_id": "QMDJ_Juan7_P029_S002",
      "original_quote": "天上時干為天乙，而六丁臨於內地，其提緩。",
      "paragraph_index": 29,
      "tag": []
    },
    {
      "line_id": "QMDJ_Juan7_P029_S003",
      "original_quote": "如值符宮剋天乙宮，而 值使臨於外地，其提急。",
      "paragraph_index": 29,
      "tag": []
    },
    {
      "line_id": "QMDJ_Juan7_P029_S004",
      "original_quote": "再有擊刑，來意至惡，三奇至善。",
      "paragraph_index": 29,
      "tag": []
    },
    {
      "line_id": "QMDJ_Juan7_P029_S005",
      "original_quote": "若相生，公差與官長相見則喜，相剋見怒。",
      "paragraph_index": 29,
      "tag": []
    },
    {
      "line_id": "QMDJ_Juan7_P029_S006",
      "original_quote": "又看六庚為天獄，落休囚一去即結，旺相則不能結。",
      "paragraph_index": 29,
      "tag": []
    },
    {
      "line_id": "QMDJ_Juan7_P030_S000",
      "original_quote": "占遷移吉凶",
      "paragraph_index": 30,
      "tag": []
    },
    {
      "line_id": "QMDJ_Juan7_P031_S000",
      "original_quote": "以九星及九宮分方向定可否，如此方上有三奇、吉門，再時得天禽，四季皆吉；",
      "paragraph_index": 31,
      "tag": []
    },
    {
      "line_id": "QMDJ_Juan7_P031_S001",
      "original_quote": "得天輔，春、夏大吉；",
      "paragraph_index": 31,
      "tag": []
    },
    {
      "line_id": "QMDJ_Juan7_P031_S002",
      "original_quote": "得天心，秋、冬大利，餘星俱不利。",
      "paragraph_index": 31,
      "tag": []
    },
    {
      "line_id": "QMDJ_Juan7_P031_S003",
      "original_quote": "各以來時占，看何星為天乙定之，觀此則以其人來之時發占，不似六壬之筮時也。",
      "paragraph_index": 31,
      "tag": []
    },
    {
      "line_id": "QMDJ_Juan7_P032_S000",
      "original_quote": "占雀噪",
      "paragraph_index": 32,
      "tag": []
    },
    {
      "line_id": "QMDJ_Juan7_P033_S000",
      "original_quote": "以朱雀為主，看朱雀所臨何奇、何門？",
      "paragraph_index": 33,
      "tag": []
    },
    {
      "line_id": "QMDJ_Juan7_P033_S001",
      "original_quote": "以決其事。",
      "paragraph_index": 33,
      "tag": []
    },
    {
      "line_id": "QMDJ_Juan7_P033_S002",
      "original_quote": "如開門得奇，主有親朋至，或行人遠歸，或主酒食此皆以開門斷之，人盤以斷人事，此舉一隅也。",
      "paragraph_index": 33,
      "tag": []
    },
    {
      "line_id": "QMDJ_Juan7_P033_S003",
      "original_quote": "休門得奇，主 有喜事休即喜也、喜信及婚姻之事。",
      "paragraph_index": 33,
      "tag": []
    },
    {
      "line_id": "QMDJ_Juan7_P033_S004",
      "original_quote": "生門得奇，主得田產、財物、豬畜之事俱切生門斷法。",
      "paragraph_index": 33,
      "tag": []
    },
    {
      "line_id": "QMDJ_Juan7_P033_S005",
      "original_quote": "若不得三門及門迫、奇墓，俱主無所關系。",
      "paragraph_index": 33,
      "tag": []
    },
    {
      "line_id": "QMDJ_Juan7_P033_S006",
      "original_quote": "要看景門臨吉格，則 有喜信，凶格則有憂信，或小煩惱。",
      "paragraph_index": 33,
      "tag": []
    },
    {
      "line_id": "QMDJ_Juan7_P034_S000",
      "original_quote": "占升遷",
      "paragraph_index": 34,
      "tag": []
    },
    {
      "line_id": "QMDJ_Juan7_P035_S000",
      "original_quote": "凡蒞任日久，薦多未見超擢，欲知升期，當以開門決之，因開門為官，掌發印也。",
      "paragraph_index": 35,
      "tag": []
    },
    {
      "line_id": "QMDJ_Juan7_P035_S001",
      "original_quote": "開加生旺宮，再有三奇、德合、吉格，必再遇歲月建乘吉神來生，定然高擢。",
      "paragraph_index": 35,
      "tag": []
    },
    {
      "line_id": "QMDJ_Juan7_P035_S002",
      "original_quote": "其有吉格，而不旺相，或旺相而無吉格，及旺相、吉格，而歲月建不來相生，亦不升也。",
      "paragraph_index": 35,
      "tag": []
    },
    {
      "line_id": "QMDJ_Juan7_P036_S000",
      "original_quote": "占鄉會試",
      "paragraph_index": 36,
      "tag": []
    },
    {
      "line_id": "QMDJ_Juan7_P037_S000",
      "original_quote": "以 日干為士子，值符總裁，天乙值使也，此指貴人言，非值符名也，疑即六壬所謂廉幕者也為房師，六丁為文章。",
      "paragraph_index": 37,
      "tag": []
    },
    {
      "line_id": "QMDJ_Juan7_P037_S001",
      "original_quote": "值符宮剋日干宮，座師不取。",
      "paragraph_index": 37,
      "tag": []
    },
    {
      "line_id": "QMDJ_Juan7_P037_S002",
      "original_quote": "天乙宮剋日干宮， 房師不薦。",
      "paragraph_index": 37,
      "tag": []
    },
    {
      "line_id": "QMDJ_Juan7_P037_S003",
      "original_quote": "六丁宮剋日干宮，日干宮剋六丁宮，及六丁休囚廢沒，俱主題目大難，文章失意。",
      "paragraph_index": 37,
      "tag": []
    },
    {
      "line_id": "QMDJ_Juan7_P037_S004",
      "original_quote": "如值符宮、天乙宮來生日干宮，六丁宮又得旺相必中，缺一不中，故必 須此格皆全乃獲，此至理也。",
      "paragraph_index": 37,
      "tag": []
    },
    {
      "line_id": "QMDJ_Juan7_P037_S005",
      "original_quote": "六壬亦當仿此法推之。",
      "paragraph_index": 37,
      "tag": []
    },
    {
      "line_id": "QMDJ_Juan7_P038_S000",
      "original_quote": "占病何日愈",
      "paragraph_index": 38,
      "tag": []
    },
    {
      "line_id": "QMDJ_Juan7_P039_S000",
      "original_quote": "以病人日干為主八字內之日，以天芮為病神，以生死二門為生死。",
      "paragraph_index": 39,
      "tag": []
    },
    {
      "line_id": "QMDJ_Juan7_P039_S001",
      "original_quote": "如日干落在生門，生主不死皆天盤，得死門者，難愈。",
      "paragraph_index": 39,
      "tag": []
    },
    {
      "line_id": "QMDJ_Juan7_P039_S002",
      "original_quote": "更遇日干休囚，得凶星、凶格，必死；",
      "paragraph_index": 39,
      "tag": []
    },
    {
      "line_id": "QMDJ_Juan7_P039_S003",
      "original_quote": "其餘六門主纏綿，以天芮廢沒之日為愈期。",
      "paragraph_index": 39,
      "tag": []
    },
    {
      "line_id": "QMDJ_Juan7_P039_S004",
      "original_quote": "占兒女病，時干入墓必死。",
      "paragraph_index": 39,
      "tag": []
    },
    {
      "line_id": "QMDJ_Juan7_P040_S000",
      "original_quote": "占干謁",
      "paragraph_index": 40,
      "tag": []
    },
    {
      "line_id": "QMDJ_Juan7_P041_S000",
      "original_quote": "干 謁專看休門宮分如天盤休加震為本宮，為所見之人，時干宮天上時干加地盤坎方為水之類為所往之人，加休門宮生時干宮，而時干宮又有三奇臨之，遂意。",
      "paragraph_index": 41,
      "tag": []
    },
    {
      "line_id": "QMDJ_Juan7_P041_S001",
      "original_quote": "如相剋制又無三奇，不得見，或不喜悅，所求不遂。",
      "paragraph_index": 41,
      "tag": []
    },
    {
      "line_id": "QMDJ_Juan7_P041_S002",
      "original_quote": "又要彼此二宮旺相，有一處休咎，即不吉。",
      "paragraph_index": 41,
      "tag": []
    },
    {
      "line_id": "QMDJ_Juan7_P041_S003",
      "original_quote": "若所見之方得休門臨之，亦相見也。",
      "paragraph_index": 41,
      "tag": []
    },
    {
      "line_id": "QMDJ_Juan7_P042_S000",
      "original_quote": "占捕捉",
      "paragraph_index": 42,
      "tag": []
    },
    {
      "line_id": "QMDJ_Juan7_P043_S000",
      "original_quote": "以六合為逃人，以傷門為捕人全以八門為主，以八門為人盤，主人事也。",
      "paragraph_index": 43,
      "tag": []
    },
    {
      "line_id": "QMDJ_Juan7_P043_S001",
      "original_quote": "如六合宮謂天盤六合所臨地盤之宮，後凡言宮皆仿此剋傷門宮，不可得，反此易得。",
      "paragraph_index": 43,
      "tag": []
    },
    {
      "line_id": "QMDJ_Juan7_P043_S002",
      "original_quote": "傷門宮生六合宮，捕人不實力，必受其賂。",
      "paragraph_index": 43,
      "tag": []
    },
    {
      "line_id": "QMDJ_Juan7_P043_S003",
      "original_quote": "傷門、六合同宮，兩相通同。",
      "paragraph_index": 43,
      "tag": []
    },
    {
      "line_id": "QMDJ_Juan7_P043_S004",
      "original_quote": "值年月日時格，則可獲，天網低亦然。",
      "paragraph_index": 43,
      "tag": []
    },
    {
      "line_id": "QMDJ_Juan7_P044_S000",
      "original_quote": "占婚姻",
      "paragraph_index": 44,
      "tag": []
    },
    {
      "line_id": "QMDJ_Juan7_P045_S000",
      "original_quote": "以六乙為女，六庚為男，取甲以乙妹娶庚之義也。",
      "paragraph_index": 45,
      "tag": []
    },
    {
      "line_id": "QMDJ_Juan7_P045_S001",
      "original_quote": "如乙庚二干落宮兩相生合則成，兩相剋則不成如地盤子卯刑之類。",
      "paragraph_index": 45,
      "tag": []
    },
    {
      "line_id": "QMDJ_Juan7_P045_S002",
      "original_quote": "又以天上六合為媒人，如六合宮生六乙宮媒向 女家，生六庚宮媒向男家，六庚宮剋六乙宮，女家畏男而不嫁。",
      "paragraph_index": 45,
      "tag": []
    },
    {
      "line_id": "QMDJ_Juan7_P045_S003",
      "original_quote": "六乙宮剋六庚宮，男家嫌女而不娶。",
      "paragraph_index": 45,
      "tag": []
    },
    {
      "line_id": "QMDJ_Juan7_P045_S004",
      "original_quote": "六乙宮帶擊刑，主女性凶惡；",
      "paragraph_index": 45,
      "tag": []
    },
    {
      "line_id": "QMDJ_Juan7_P045_S005",
      "original_quote": "帶德合，女性堅貞。",
      "paragraph_index": 45,
      "tag": []
    },
    {
      "line_id": "QMDJ_Juan7_P045_S006",
      "original_quote": "六庚宮帶凶 神，主男性暴烈，帶德合，主溫厚。",
      "paragraph_index": 45,
      "tag": []
    },
    {
      "line_id": "QMDJ_Juan7_P046_S000",
      "original_quote": "占走失",
      "paragraph_index": 46,
      "tag": []
    },
    {
      "line_id": "QMDJ_Juan7_P047_S000",
      "original_quote": "以時干為失主與六壬之用干同理，六合為逃走之物，俱以落宮論之，又以六合宮與時干落宮，看在內外以分遠近。",
      "paragraph_index": 47,
      "tag": []
    },
    {
      "line_id": "QMDJ_Juan7_P047_S001",
      "original_quote": "如日干、六合俱在內，易尋，俱在外，難尋。",
      "paragraph_index": 47,
      "tag": []
    },
    {
      "line_id": "QMDJ_Juan7_P047_S002",
      "original_quote": "六 合在外，時干在內，難尋。",
      "paragraph_index": 47,
      "tag": []
    },
    {
      "line_id": "QMDJ_Juan7_P047_S003",
      "original_quote": "又以六合所在之宮為方向，如得旺相星，又乘開休生杜四門，不可得，反此可得。",
      "paragraph_index": 47,
      "tag": []
    },
    {
      "line_id": "QMDJ_Juan7_P047_S004",
      "original_quote": "乘九地、太陰，有人潛藏；",
      "paragraph_index": 47,
      "tag": []
    },
    {
      "line_id": "QMDJ_Juan7_P047_S005",
      "original_quote": "乘九天遠走，乘元武被人盜 去，乘螣蛇有人盤詰羈縻，乘朱雀有信，勾陳有勾引而去以上指六壬所乘而言也。",
      "paragraph_index": 47,
      "tag": []
    },
    {
      "line_id": "QMDJ_Juan7_P047_S006",
      "original_quote": "又看六庚，年格則年獲，月格則月獲，日格則日獲，時格則時獲。",
      "paragraph_index": 47,
      "tag": []
    },
    {
      "line_id": "QMDJ_Juan7_P048_S000",
      "original_quote": "占借貸",
      "paragraph_index": 48,
      "tag": []
    },
    {
      "line_id": "QMDJ_Juan7_P049_S000",
      "original_quote": "以值符為物主，天乙即值使，俱仿此推為往借之人，各以所落宮分生剋論之。",
      "paragraph_index": 49,
      "tag": []
    },
    {
      "line_id": "QMDJ_Juan7_P049_S001",
      "original_quote": "值符宮生天乙宮，天乙宮剋值符宮，借貸必遂；",
      "paragraph_index": 49,
      "tag": []
    },
    {
      "line_id": "QMDJ_Juan7_P049_S002",
      "original_quote": "值符宮剋天乙宮，天乙宮生值符宮，借貸不遂。",
      "paragraph_index": 49,
      "tag": []
    },
    {
      "line_id": "QMDJ_Juan7_P050_S000",
      "original_quote": "占武舉",
      "paragraph_index": 50,
      "tag": []
    },
    {
      "line_id": "QMDJ_Juan7_P051_S000",
      "original_quote": "以值符為主考，時干為舉子，甲申庚為箭，甲午辛為紅心，景門為策論。",
      "paragraph_index": 51,
      "tag": []
    },
    {
      "line_id": "QMDJ_Juan7_P051_S001",
      "original_quote": "專看甲申庚落宮若剋甲午辛之宮，或衝其宮皆為箭中紅心，再看景門得旺相，又與值符宮相生者，主中。",
      "paragraph_index": 51,
      "tag": []
    },
    {
      "line_id": "QMDJ_Juan7_P051_S002",
      "original_quote": "缺一不中箭論。",
      "paragraph_index": 51,
      "tag": []
    },
    {
      "line_id": "QMDJ_Juan7_P052_S000",
      "original_quote": "占求財",
      "paragraph_index": 52,
      "tag": []
    },
    {
      "line_id": "QMDJ_Juan7_P053_S000",
      "original_quote": "當分休囚，以生門所落之宮，為休生開上所乘之星為用，用生休吉，休生咎，則不吉，囚旺休衰，休雖剋囚，不為大吉。",
      "paragraph_index": 53,
      "tag": []
    },
    {
      "line_id": "QMDJ_Juan7_P053_S001",
      "original_quote": "休旺衰囚，雖剋休亦無大害，大抵看門所落宮分，再看上下三盤，格局吉凶何如？",
      "paragraph_index": 53,
      "tag": []
    },
    {
      "line_id": "QMDJ_Juan7_P053_S002",
      "original_quote": "吉信吉星，所求如意，一有不吉，所求僅半，休囚不吉，所求全無。",
      "paragraph_index": 53,
      "tag": []
    },
    {
      "line_id": "QMDJ_Juan7_P054_S000",
      "original_quote": "占船主善惡",
      "paragraph_index": 54,
      "tag": []
    },
    {
      "line_id": "QMDJ_Juan7_P055_S000",
      "original_quote": "以震三宮為船主，以天盤上所得之星，為船主之善惡。",
      "paragraph_index": 55,
      "tag": []
    },
    {
      "line_id": "QMDJ_Juan7_P055_S001",
      "original_quote": "震宮上得輔心禽三星為上吉，衝任為中吉，其船家是好人。",
      "paragraph_index": 55,
      "tag": []
    },
    {
      "line_id": "QMDJ_Juan7_P055_S002",
      "original_quote": "得英、芮、杜、蓬為大凶，船不可登。",
      "paragraph_index": 55,
      "tag": []
    },
    {
      "line_id": "QMDJ_Juan7_P056_S000",
      "original_quote": "占出外之人安否",
      "paragraph_index": 56,
      "tag": []
    },
    {
      "line_id": "QMDJ_Juan7_P057_S000",
      "original_quote": "先定方向，看其方上下二盤得三奇吉門天地二門俱有奇門及諸吉格者，安；",
      "paragraph_index": 57,
      "tag": []
    },
    {
      "line_id": "QMDJ_Juan7_P057_S001",
      "original_quote": "反此不安。",
      "paragraph_index": 57,
      "tag": []
    },
    {
      "line_id": "QMDJ_Juan7_P058_S000",
      "original_quote": "占訪友",
      "paragraph_index": 58,
      "tag": []
    },
    {
      "line_id": "QMDJ_Juan7_P059_S000",
      "original_quote": "大凡奇門用事，專擇方向與時耳。",
      "paragraph_index": 59,
      "tag": []
    },
    {
      "line_id": "QMDJ_Juan7_P059_S001",
      "original_quote": "如我欲訪友尋人，以所往之方地盤為主，天盤為客，主客要相生合，又得吉門、吉星必相遷。",
      "paragraph_index": 59,
      "tag": []
    },
    {
      "line_id": "QMDJ_Juan7_P059_S002",
      "original_quote": "若門凶，上下兩盤又相剋制，則不遷也。",
      "paragraph_index": 59,
      "tag": []
    },
    {
      "line_id": "QMDJ_Juan7_P059_S003",
      "original_quote": "庚為年月日時格，值此亦不遷也。",
      "paragraph_index": 59,
      "tag": []
    },
    {
